  "1": [
    {
      "text": "Global silver demand hit a new all-time",
      "startSec": 0,
      "endSec": 1.79
    },
    {
      "text": "record in 2023 at 124 billion ounces.",
      "startSec": 1.79,
      "endSec": 4.48
    },
    {
      "text": "This was not driven by retail spec",
      "startSec": 4.48,
      "endSec": 6.39
    },
    {
      "text": "ulators.",
      "startSec": 6.39,
      "endSec": 6.88
    },
    {
      "text": "Industrial applications now account for",
      "startSec": 6.88,
      "endSec": 9.37
    },
    {
      "text": "58% of all silver consumed worldwide,",
      "startSec": 9.37,
      "endSec": 11.6
    },
    {
      "text": "and that share keeps climbing each year",
      "startSec": 11.6,
      "endSec": 13.56
    },
    {
      "text": ".",
      "startSec": 13.56,
      "endSec": 15.2
    }
  ],
  "2": [
    {
      "text": "Industrial demand now drives more than",
      "startSec": 0,
      "endSec": 2.1
    },
    {
      "text": "half of all silver consumption.",
      "startSec": 2.1,
      "endSec": 4.32
    },
    {
      "text": "Solar panels alone consumed around 140",
      "startSec": 4.32,
      "endSec": 7.05
    },
    {
      "text": "million ounces in 2023.",
      "startSec": 7.05,
      "endSec": 9.02
    },
    {
      "text": "Electric vehicles add 25 to 50 grams of",
      "startSec": 9.02,
      "endSec": 11.55
    },
    {
      "text": "silver per car.",
      "startSec": 11.55,
      "endSec": 12.56
    },
    {
      "text": "Both sectors are growing fast and",
      "startSec": 12.56,
      "endSec": 14.09
    },
    {
      "text": "neither is slowing down.",
      "startSec": 14.09,
      "endSec": 15.36
    }
  ],
  "3": [
    {
      "text": "In 2023, the world used 200 million",
      "startSec": 0,
      "endSec": 2.56
    },
    {
      "text": "more ounces of silver than it mined.",
      "startSec": 2.56,
      "endSec": 4.74
    },
    {
      "text": "That was the second consecutive year of",
      "startSec": 4.74,
      "endSec": 6.32
    },
    {
      "text": "a major supply deficit.",
      "startSec": 6.32,
      "endSec": 7.46
    },
    {
      "text": "Global mine production has been flat",
      "startSec": 7.46,
      "endSec": 9.22
    },
    {
      "text": "for years.",
      "startSec": 9.22,
      "endSec": 9.86
    },
    {
      "text": "The gap gets filled by above ground",
      "startSec": 9.86,
      "endSec": 11.35
    },
    {
      "text": "stockpiles, and those stockpiles are",
      "startSec": 11.35,
      "endSec": 12.81
    },
    {
      "text": "finite.",
      "startSec": 12.81,
      "endSec": 13.18
    }
  ],
  "4": [
    {
